    "body": "I would also like this option.\n\nA way to smartly determine the useful precision for the time.\n\nSomething like:\n\n| duration | result |\n| -------- | ------ |\n| below 2 seconds | show total milliseconds |\n| below 1.5 minutes | show total seconds |\n| below 1.25 hours | show total minutes |\n| below 1 day | show total hours |\n\nI get that we really don't want commands running longer than that, but I have had rclone operations that have run over multiple days.",
